This isn't currently possible, sorry. However, I'm currently working on supporting Layers Control <http://leafletjs.com/examples/layers-control.html> which will give you a much more direct way to express this.

On Tue, Jun 2, 2015 at 2:03 PM ArjunaCap <mcaw...@greenstenergy.com> wrote:

