Subject: plots: Is it possible to differentiate click from brush?
Message-ID: <aOGS486quFc.n8FwUafCbgYJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/shiny-discuss/c/aOGS486quFc/m/n8FwUafCbgYJ>
