Definitely don't use `cat()`, that won't help you at all.

That aside, input$value will be a single-element character vector--you probably want a character vector with one element per column. Take a look at the strsplit function, for example if the column names are space separated it'd be cols <- strsplit(input$value, " ")[[1]]. Or if separated by commas with optional whitespace, then cols <- strsplit(input$value, "\\s*,\\s*")[[1]].

