Use rename_ instead of rename and it should work.

rename uses non-standard evaluation <http://adv-r.had.co.nz/Computing-on-the-language.html> which is more convenient until you have indirection like this (i.e. "input$horizon" is not the actual name; the value of input$horizon is the name). rename_ uses standard evaluation for just this reason.

