Subject: How do I find out whether code is running inside Shiny?
Message-ID: <cGQwYkGpDRo.FWYG67xrZkgJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/shiny-discuss/c/cGQwYkGpDRo/m/FWYG67xrZkgJ>
